# ── App Environment ──────────────────────────────────────────
# APP_ENV=local          # local | production
                          # local: no Twig cache, dev-reload endpoint enabled

# ── Rate Limiting ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Token-bucket per IP. Burst of RATE_LIMIT requests, then
# sustained at RATE_LIMIT / RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW req/s.
# Defaults shown below. Set RATE_LIMIT=0 to disable (not yet wired).

# RATE_LIMIT=60          # max requests per window (default: 60)
# RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW=60   # window duration in seconds (default: 60)

# ── Trusted Proxy / Client IP Resolution ────────────────────
# Controls how the real client IP is determined when the app
# sits behind a reverse proxy (nginx, Traefik, Cloudflare, etc.).
#
# TRUST_PROXY — operating mode:
#   0           Never trust proxies — always use REMOTE_ADDR.
#   1           Always trust — read from PROXY_IP_HEADER.
#   auto        Auto-detect: trust only when REMOTE_ADDR is
#               private (Docker/LAN) or a known Cloudflare IP.
#   cloudflare  Validate REMOTE_ADDR against Cloudflare IP ranges
#               before trusting CF-Connecting-IP header.
#   traefik     Trust X-Forwarded-For only when REMOTE_ADDR
#               is on a Docker/local network.
#
# PROXY_IP_HEADER — the header to read for the real IP when
# TRUST_PROXY is 1, auto, or traefik.
#   Default: X-Forwarded-For

# TRUST_PROXY=auto
# PROXY_IP_HEADER=X-Forwarded-For
